sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant O as My Orders
  participant D as Order Details
  participant F as Order Form
  participant A as My Account
  participant S as Server
  C->>O: 1: Tap My Orders (Active, History)
  O->>S: 2: GET /api/orders
  C->>O: 3: Tap an order
  O->>D: 4: Open Order Details
  D->>S: 5: GET /api/orders/{id}
  S-->>D: 6: 7 steps, estimated delivery, rider on the map
  S-->>D: 7: Live updates: Out for Delivery, Arriving, Arrived, Delivered
  opt Waiting to be accepted
    C->>D: 8: Cancel order, Confirm
    D->>S: 9: POST /api/orders/{id}/cancel
  end
  C->>D: 10: Call station
  C->>O: 11: History, tap Reorder
  O->>F: 12: Order Form with the same gallons and address
  C->>A: 13: Tap My Account
  A-->>C: 14: Profile, saved addresses (add, edit, delete), change password, log out
  opt Guest
    C->>A: 15: Create account or Exit guest mode
  end
